# The repository-wide .gitignore excludes `[Ll]ogs/` and any directory named
# `gen`, both of which this exploration uses by name. Without these re-inclusions
# a slice agent commits its generator and its raw logs as nothing at all, and
# finds out a session later. `schema/` sidesteps it by avoiding the names; the
# slices do not, because `poc/<lang>/gen/` and `logs/<lang>/` are what
# README section 12 tells them to write.
!logs/
!logs/**
!poc/*/gen/
!poc/*/gen/**
